    "Apple limits this to 50 domains. Add domains that you want to remain accessible during sessions.": {
      "comment": "Message explaining that Apple limits the number of domains that can be added for a specific purpose (e.g., allowing or blocking). It also includes a suggestion for what to do about it.",
